From: DE25-Nano port
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: enable mousedev for MiSTer pointer input

Main consumes physical relative-pointer motion through /dev/input/mouseX.
Build mousedev as a module so the DE25 runtime can provide that compatibility
interface while retaining evdev for keyboard and button handling.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -439,6 +439,7 @@
 CONFIG_MHI_WWAN_CTRL=m
 CONFIG_MHI_WWAN_MBIM=m
 CONFIG_INPUT_EVDEV=y
+CONFIG_INPUT_MOUSEDEV=m
 CONFIG_KEYBOARD_ADC=m
 CONFIG_KEYBOARD_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_KEYBOARD_GPIO_POLLED=m
